  "description": "Hand drawn by artist – 100% original artwork, not AI-generated!\nAdd royal charm and glamorous confidence to your designs with this lovely Princess Clipart Bundle! This collection includes 14 high-quality PNG files featuring stylish girls wearing elegant crowns adorned with pink and gold jewels, sipping coffee, and rocking chic black outfits with heart-shaped sunglasses in black or pink frames. Each illustration is carefully hand-drawn with attention to details, diverse skin tones and hairstyles (blonde waves, dark updos, ponytails).\nPerfect for: self-love graphics, motivational quotes, planner stickers, t-shirts, mugs, tumblers, invitations, social media posts, scrapbooking, Canva templates, Cricut crafts, journals, printable wall art, girl boss projects, queen vibes designs, coffee lover art and more.\nHighlights:\nHand drawn & unique — authentic princess style with crowns, coffee cups, heart sunglasses and glamorous fashion\n14 individual PNG files on transparent background\nHigh resolution 300 DPI, scalable for any size\nInstant digital download – ready to use immediately\nBring that “treat yourself like a queen” energy to every project with these hand-drawn princess girls! Download now and create bold, empowering, adorable designs. 👑☕💖",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Hand drawn by artist – 100% original artwork, not AI-generated!</p>\n<p>Add royal charm and glamorous confidence to your designs with this lovely Princess Clipart Bundle! This collection includes 14 high-quality PNG files featuring stylish girls wearing elegant crowns adorned with pink and gold jewels, sipping coffee, and rocking chic black outfits with heart-shaped sunglasses in black or pink frames. Each illustration is carefully hand-drawn with attention to details, diverse skin tones and hairstyles (blonde waves, dark updos, ponytails).<br>\nPerfect for: self-love graphics, motivational quotes, planner stickers, t-shirts, mugs, tumblers, invitations, social media posts, scrapbooking, Canva templates, Cricut crafts, journals, printable wall art, girl boss projects, queen vibes designs, coffee lover art and more.<br>\nHighlights:</p>\n<p>Hand drawn &amp; unique — authentic princess style with crowns, coffee cups, heart sunglasses and glamorous fashion<br>\n14 individual PNG files on transparent background<br>\nHigh resolution 300 DPI, scalable for any size<br>\nInstant digital download – ready to use immediately</p>\n<p>Bring that “treat yourself like a queen” energy to every project with these hand-drawn princess girls! Download now and create bold, empowering, adorable designs. 👑☕💖</p>",
